IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-OFFLOAD.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-LAYERS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACTIVE-SEQ-LEN      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 TRANSFERRED-PAGES   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-OFFLOAD.
    IF NUM-LAYERS == 0 OR ACTIVE-SEQ-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-LAYERS TO TRANSFERRED-PAGES.
    MULTIPLY ACTIVE-SEQ-LEN BY TRANSFERRED-PAGES.
    DIVIDE 64 INTO TRANSFERRED-PAGES.

    MOVE 342 TO SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-LAYERS.
    WEIGHT 30 TRANSFERRED-PAGES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
